{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\" style='text-align: left; margin: 16px 0px; color: rgb(15, 17, 21); font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \"Open Sans\", \"Helvetica Neue\", sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;'>青海大學科研團隊每年7月都會深入可可西里，在藏羚羊產子季進行野外調查。研究人員從新鮮糞便、胎盤等組織中，採集樣本進行基因分析。由於高原陽光會迅速降解DNA，團隊必須在清晨時段採集。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"8492511_可可西里考察 藏羚基因揭秘 - 截图7\" src=\"http://outin-63362ff8bc7011f09c8900163e08026a.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/4b0c222b02a64d4eb91f339c26387c11/snapshots/4fee363c3d5f4c22be59423feeb27f85-00007.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"视频 8492511_可可西里考察 藏羚基因揭秘 的第7张截图\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\" style='text-align: left; margin: 16px 0px; color: rgb(15, 17, 21); font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \"Open Sans\", \"Helvetica Neue\", sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;'>考察期間，團隊發現一對自然死亡的公藏羚羊角，證實雄性亦分布於產子地，打破以往僅有母羊聚集的迷思。新生幼羊會以與土壤色澤相近的淺棕色毛髮作為偽裝，靜待母親覓食歸來。</p><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\" style='text-align: left; margin-top: 16px; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(15, 17, 21); font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \"Open Sans\", \"Helvetica Neue\", sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-bottom: 0px !important;'>為期21天的考察共採集了619份樣本，團隊運用無人機及人工智能識別技術，實時記錄藏羚羊的活動軌跡，為物種保育提供重要科學數據。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-06T00:08:05.784611+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":236,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}